Each of these single-point mutations of src/arci/adapters/langchain.py passes all 200 tests in tests/unit/adapters and tests/unit/toolbox:
- (a) dropping the schema source (line 180);
- (b) never advancing session.attempt (line 445);
- (c) also classifying by `__context__`;
- (d) classifying any OSError as infrastructure;
- (e) 5xx bounds moved to 501 or 600, or the int guard removed;
